WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:01.960
Hi, we're Hackstreet Boys!

00:02.050 --> 00:03.758
Abandoned but not Forgotten.

00:03.758 --> 00:05.100
Some still work today!

00:05.500 --> 00:07.307
This is Pieces of Home.

00:07.307 --> 00:08.250
Left behind.

00:08.250 --> 00:09.350
Still shining.

00:10.150 --> 00:13.896
